@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@
+Feature: Todo Editing
+  As a user
+  I want to edit existing todos
+  So that I can correct or update task descriptions
+
+  Background:
+    Given the page is loaded
+    And I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: Activate editing mode
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a todo label enters edit mode
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    Then the item "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" is focused
+    And the edit input for "Buy milk" contains "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: Save on blur
+
+  Scenario: Edit is saved when the edit input loses focus
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to "Buy oat milk"
+    And the edit input loses focus
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the item "Buy oat milk" does not have class "editing"
+    And the item "Buy milk" does not exist
+
+  Rule: Save on Enter
+
+  Scenario: Edit is saved when Enter is pressed
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the item "Buy oat milk" does not have class "editing"
+
+  Rule: Trimming during edit
+
+  Scenario: Edit input is trimmed before saving
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to "   Buy oat milk   "
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo list contains 1 item
+    And the remaining item has title "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Rule: Empty edit destroys todo
+
+  Scenario: Empty edit destroys the todo
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to ""
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only edit destroys the todo
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to "   "
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo list contains 0 items
+
+  Rule: Escape discards edit
+
+  Scenario: Escape key discards the edit and restores original title
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit input to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Escape in the edit input
+    Then the edit input for "Buy milk" is not visible
+    And the item "Buy milk" does not have class "editing"
+    And the item "Buy milk" has title "Buy milk"
