@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+Feature: Todo Toggle All
+  As a user
+  I want to mark all todos as complete or active at once
+  So that I can batch-update status
+
+  Background:
+    Given the page is loaded
+
+  Rule: Toggle all from unchecked state
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete marks every todo done
+    Given I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo with text "Walk dog"
+    And I create a todo with text "Read"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the item "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And the item "Walk dog" has class "completed"
+    And the item "Read" has class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all from checked state marks every todo active
+    Given I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo with text "Walk dog"
+    And I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the item "Buy milk" does not have class "completed"
+    And the item "Walk dog" does not have class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Toggle-all reflects individual item state
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox is checked when all todos are completed
+    Given I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo with text "Walk dog"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox is unchecked when any todo is active
+    Given I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo with text "Walk dog"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Clear completed resets toggle-all state
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all is unchecked after clear completed
+    Given I create a todo with text "Buy milk"
+    And I create a todo with text "Walk dog"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for "Walk dog"
+    And I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
